  "answer_text": "Cato supports BFD for BGP neighbors on IPsec and Cloud Interconnect sites. Passive BFD is supported for all sites (including Sockets and vSockets). BFD is used in asynchronous mode; timers are negotiated and Cato initiates BFD by default if there is at least one BFD-enabled active peer. The UDP port used by multi-hop BFD is not specified in the KB.",
